  |
3 | from 'data/order.csv' | union p
  |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ no file at this path
  |
  = help: a file with a similar name exists: `data/orders.csv`

error[DS3001]: file `data/order.csv` not found
  --> query:3:31
  |
3 | from 'data/order.csv' | union p
